os": [1656.54296875, 311.846435546875], "widgets_values": ["**【全局参数 / Global Prompt】**\n**中文：** 一个年轻美丽的女人，梳着一条粗麻花辫搭在身前，穿着浅灰色底带蓝色花朵图案的紧身吊带连衣裙。明亮的现代化服装店内，背景两侧是挂满衣服的衣架。室内柔和照明，浅景深，逼真的电影摄影质感。\n**English:** A beautiful young woman with a thick braided pigtail resting on her front, wearing a light grey tight slip dress with blue floral patterns. Bright modern clothing store, with racks of clothes on both sides in the background. Soft indoor lighting, shallow depth of field, photorealistic cinematic texture.\n\n**【分镜 1 / Shot 1】** *(预计时长 / Length: 3s)*\n**中文：** 全身镜头，镜头同步后撤。女人直视镜头，步态优雅地向前走来，双臂自然摆动。\n**English:** Full body shot, the camera tracks backward synchronously. The woman looks directly at the camera and walks forward with an elegant gait, her arms swinging naturally.\n\n**【分镜 2 / Shot 2】** *(预计时长 / Length: 4s)*\n**中文：** 全身镜头，镜头继续同步平稳后撤。女人保持向前走，将一只手放在臀部一侧，轻轻向下抚平裙子上的褶皱。\n**English:** Full body shot, the camera continues to track backward smoothly synchronously. The woman keeps walking forward, places one hand on the side of her hip, and gently smooths out the wrinkles on her dress downwards.\n\n**【分镜 3 / Shot 3】** *(预计时长 / Length: 3s)*\n**中文：** 全身镜头，镜头保持后撤。女人一边向前走，一边抬起手将搭在胸前的麻花辫子轻轻撩到肩膀身后。\n**English:** Full body shot, the camera keeps tracking backward. As the woman walks forward, she raises her hand and gently tosses the braided pigtail resting on her chest behind her shoulder.\n\n**【分镜 4 / Shot 4】** *(预计时长 / Length: 2s)*\n**中文：** 全身镜头，镜头随之后退。女人放下手臂恢复自然摆动，保持优雅的步伐继续走向镜头。\n**English:** Full body shot, the camera tracks backward accordingly. The woman lowers her arm to resume swinging naturally, maintaining an elegant pace as she continues to walk towards the camera."], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 16, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 17, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 18}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "I